Moria Source-Available License v1
Copyright 2026-present hablethedev

0. Definitions

In this file:

"Software" refers to the Minecraft plugin Moria, including source code, binaries, and official releases.

"Author" refers to hablethedev, the holder of the copyright for Moria.

"Modrinth Page" refers to the following page for the Software:
https://modrinth.com/plugin/moria

"Content" refers to public media or creative works that display, demonstrate, use, or otherwise feature the Software, including livestreams, screenshots, articles, videos, and similar.

"Modified Version" refers to any version of the Software that has been modified, patched, forked, rebuilt, or otherwise derived from the Software.

"Minecraft Server" refers to any software running a server that Minecraft clients can connect to. This includes PaperMC, Pumpkin, Bukkit, and other similar software.

